    temper, strange apocalyptic dreams, an obsession with dragon hunting, or some
    other touch of his influence. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength
    or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You''re trained in the Athletics
    skill and the Dragon Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Titan
